NotesStoreLane runs (xd6702, tern-ci image, Go 1.27.3; scratch copy of the synced worktree, test files of other lanes excluded where they were mid-edit)

== go vet, whole package incl. other lanes' files (components/posthorse/extensions/posthorse)
GOOS=linux   clean
GOOS=darwin  clean
GOOS=windows clean
(also clean on the filtered copy: lane tests + fixtures)

== go test -race -count=3 -run 'TestFork_|TestNote' .
ok  	github.com/MichaelKinsy/pigpen/posthorse	7.416s
59 test functions of the lane (+75 binding-schema and 28 touch-schema table cases) x 3, race detector on.

