== benchmarks (go test -bench Note -benchmem -benchtime=20x; Intel Xeon Platinum 8468, 8 procs)
BenchmarkNoteSnapshot300-8             21.26 ms/op   6372426 B/op   59771 allocs/op   (300 notes of ~1 KiB: copy, verify, digest, manifest, rename)
BenchmarkNotesUnder500-8                5.47 ms/op    661938 B/op    5704 allocs/op   (500 notes in 25 folders)
BenchmarkNoteCollapse600Cold-8         28.37 ms/op   4065217 B/op   29162 allocs/op   (300 identical pairs, digests computed)
BenchmarkNoteCollapse600Warm-8         16.93 ms/op   3259585 B/op   25143 allocs/op   (digest cache warm; the cost left is one canonicalPath per revision lookup, as in the original)
BenchmarkNoteBindingsOf3000-8           3.26 ms/op   1081472 B/op   23008 allocs/op   (1000 fork bindings with a seed, 3000-entry journal)
BenchmarkNoteTouchRecords3000-8         1.23 ms/op    402704 B/op    3011 allocs/op
BenchmarkNoteSessionNoteTouches3000-8   6.74 ms/op   3215275 B/op   30097 allocs/op
max RSS of the whole benchmark process (all seven, 20 iterations each): 18308 KiB
Not compared against the TypeScript original (no cheap harness for the same inputs; PerfLane owns the Pi-vs-PiG measurement).
